.\" eqnrc - eqn(1)'s settings for Libertinus Math: read before a
.\" document's equations (book(1) puts it first when there are any)
.\"
.\" the mathematical symbols the text fonts lack, from the math font
.fspecial R S
.fspecial I S
.fspecial B S
.\" rules: fractions' and radicals' bars, as one line however long
.char \(ru \f[S]\N'uni23AF'
.char \(rn \f[S]\N'uni23AF'
.\" Libertinus Math's own parameters (its MATH table's), for TeX's from
.\" Computer Modern: hundredths of an em, as LuaTeX maps them;
.\" characters' classes as TeX's (! and ? closing, . ordinary, : a
.\" relation); the names of functions operators, as TeX's: a thin space each side
.\" (none before a parenthesis), limits under lim and max in a display;
.\" an integral's limits beside it, as TeX's, its lower limit under its
.\" tail by its italic correction (the MATH table's); TeX's names for its dots,
.\" nabla and h-bar (eqn's own: ..., cdot, del, grad) and its triple and
.\" contour integrals
.EQ
set text_limits 1
set script_percent_scale_down 80
set script_script_percent_scale_down 60
set axis_height 26
set x_height 43
set default_rule_thickness 7
set num1 58
